hared empty pointer → {}\nOtherwise → shallow own-data copy.\nIf no own key, guard assigns the capture.","fontSize":22,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Local params is always fresh.\\nShared empty pointer → {}\\nOtherwise → shallow own-data copy.\\nThe guard adds a missing capture.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.15,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"IhOxfwSLPXCJ9W2g5DFbh","type":"text","x":650,"y":630,"width":560,"height":151.8,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"aq","roundness":null,"seed":1285682318,"version":4,"versionNonce":1420186530,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1792896050028,"created":1792896050027,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Actual argument order matters:\n4th: parent node.#params\n5th: fresh local params\n\nFirst key: use truthy local value.\nLater keys: non-nullish parent wins.","fontSize":22,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Actual argument order matters:\\n4th: parent node.#params\\n5th: fresh local params\\n\\nFirst key: use truthy local value.\\nLater keys: non-nullish parent wins.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.15,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"vYDvnYNF9Do5zFdNjqr_L","type":"text","x":650,"y":950,"width":560,"height":126.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#c92a2a","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"ar","roundness":null,"seed":1041228626,"version":5,"versionNonce":1097666494,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1792896050028,"created":1792896050028,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Why constructor is surprising\nParent inherits Object.prototype.constructor.\nAs a later key it can win over\nthe captured string. Keep the function\nvisible in the observer.","fontSize":22,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Why constructor is surprising\\nParent inherits Object.constructor.\\nAs a later key it can win over\\nthe captured string. Keep the function\\nvisible in the observer.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.15,"labelPosition":null},{"id":"y9CiEumztFzy1wQTOP6ST","type":"text","x":650,"y":1240,"width":560,"height":177.1,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#5f3dc4","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"as","roundness":null,"seed":1439707854,"version":4,"versionNonce":362778466,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1792896050028,"created":1792896050028,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Conditional source-model proof\nExact fragments + current data facts.\nRepeated records stay live aliases.\n\nRegex production, traversal, getters,\nproxies and full native adequacy\nremain open.","fontSize":22,"baseFontSize":null,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Conditional source-model proof\\nExact fragments + current data facts.\\nRepeated records stay live aliases.\\n\\nRegex production, traversal, getters,\\nproxies and full native adequacy\\nremain open.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.15,"labelPosition":null}],"sceneVersion":"33d46313","files":{}}
